    "exampleCode": "# Tuple definition and unpacking\npoint = (10, 20, 30)\nx, y, z = point\nprint(f\"Point coordinates: x={x}, y={y}, z={z}\")\n\n# Single-element tuple requirement (trailing comma)\nsingle = (42,)\nprint(\"Type of (42,):\", type(single).__name__)\nnot_tuple = (42)\nprint(\"Type of (42):\", type(not_tuple).__name__)",
    "expectedOutput": "Point coordinates: x=10, y=20, z=30\nType of (42,): tuple\nType of (42): int",
