    "content": "### Java Break, Continue & Labeled Loops\n\nControl statements alter standard sequential loop flow.\n\n#### Control Behaviors\n- **`break`**: Immediately terminates loop execution.\n- **`continue`**: Skips the remaining code in current iteration and progresses to update step.\n- **Labeled Loops**: Java supports labels (e.g. `outerLoop: for(...)`) allowing an inner loop to `break` or `continue` an outer enclosing loop directly.\n",
