    "exampleCode": "-- Transaction Control Example\nBEGIN TRANSACTION;\n\nINSERT INTO audit_logs (event, timestamp)\nVALUES ('SYSTEM_MAINTENANCE_WINDOW', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);\n\n-- Verify and commit atomically\nCOMMIT;\n\nSELECT 'Transaction committed successfully' AS result;",
